  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/some-spooky-cave-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#169179\">在此下載《Some Scary Cave Additions》！</span></a></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">神秘人影是你新的「友好」鄰居，他會注視著你、敲你的門，甚至在你睡覺時盯著你看……</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><br>本模組為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-knocker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Knocker</a> 的改版（</span><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">作者：Ma_Do)，僅替換部分音效與主要實體貼圖。&nbsp;<br><br><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">注意！本模組可能與 The Knocker 不相容，且若已安裝該模組可能無法正常運作。</span> <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"></span></strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>貼圖作者：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/vviabushka/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">vviabushka</span></a>（沒錯，就是 Bath 模組的作者）</strong></span><br><br></span></span></p>",
